==Chinese==
{{zh-forms|s=一石二鸟}}

===Etymology===
Literally: one stone, two birds

===Pronunciation===
{{zh-pron
|m=一shí'èrniǎo
|c=jat1 sek6 ji6 niu5
|cat=idiom
}}

===Idiom===
{{zh-idiom}}

# [[kill two birds with one stone]]; do one task and finish two or more goals; ''(literally, one stone two birds)''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|zh|一箭雙雕}}, {{l|zh|一箭雙鵰}}
* {{l|zh|一舉兩得}}

